     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CarteDeConcepts FRDataEntererLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"FRDataEntererLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"hcFRDataEntererLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Groupe 1 </b>Mapping de <a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMDataEnterer.html\">Logical model - FR LM Data Enterer</a> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-data-enterer.html\">CDA - dataEnterer</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMDataEnterer.html#s-FRLMDataEnterer\">FRLMDataEnterer</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-data-enterer.html#s-DataEnterer\">DataEnterer</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMDataEnterer.html#s-FRLMDataEnterer.date\">FRLMDataEnterer.date</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-data-enterer.html#s-DataEnterer.time\">DataEnterer.time</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMDataEnterer.dataEnterer:healthProfessional</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-data-enterer.html#s-DataEnterer.assignedEntity\">DataEnterer.assignedEntity</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td>L'opérateur de saisie professionnel de santé est de type FRLMHealthProfessional, cf. FRHealthProfessionalLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMDataEnterer.dataEnterer:patient</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-data-enterer.html#s-DataEnterer.assignedEntity\">DataEnterer.assignedEntity</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td>L'opérateur de saisie patient/usager est de type FRLMPatient, cf. FRPatientLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Groupe 2 </b>Mapping de <a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMDataEnterer.html\">Logical model - FR LM Data Enterer</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/fhir-clinical-document/STU1.1/StructureDefinition-data-enterer-extension.html\">Data Enterer Extension</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMDataEnterer.html#s-FRLMDataEnterer\">FRLMDataEnterer</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/fhir-clinical-document/STU1.1/StructureDefinition-data-enterer-extension.html#s-Extension\">Extension</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMDataEnterer.html#s-FRLMDataEnterer.date\">FRLMDataEnterer.date</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/fhir-clinical-document/STU1.1/StructureDefinition-data-enterer-extension.html#s-Extension.extension:time.value[x]\">Extension.extension:time.value[x]</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMDataEnterer.dataEnterer:healthProfessional</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/fhir-clinical-document/STU1.1/StructureDefinition-data-enterer-extension.html#s-Extension.extension:party.value[x]\">Extension.extension:party.value[x]</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Extension.extension:party.value[x].resolve().ofType(PractitionerRole) — cf. FRHealthProfessionalLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMDataEnterer.dataEnterer:patient</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/fhir-clinical-document/STU1.1/StructureDefinition-data-enterer-extension.html#s-Extension.extension:party.value[x]\">Extension.extension:party.value[x]</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Extension.extension:party.value[x].resolve().ofType(Patient) — cf. FRPatientLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr></table></div>"
